                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 758,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1428,
                            "last_played": 1793383023
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Is it fun? Yes\nDoes stuff wig out frequently and you need to be creative to fix bugs and issues? Also yes\nVery very enjoyable and accessible. Not as in-depth as some other park builders. You don't need to have studied zoology to build a nice enclosure for this. But the game developement is obviously a bit lacking in some departments. Nothing a few QOL mods couldnt fix, if there were any \nAlso the DLCs are very in your face. And the aquatic one is even worse for some pathing issues. I have gotten it to work everytime so far by just spamming feeders everywhere and eventually they will find one of them, lol.\nObjective 6/10 for me, but I enjoy it as much as a 8.5/10",
